CVE-2026-41845: Escape backtick and dollar in JavaScriptUtils

Refine JavaScriptUtils#javaScriptEscape to escape '`' and '$' so values
cannot break out of JavaScript template literals (XSS).

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/commit/86d99790dbaa8ce6bb1087ef92844d0abfdab015
  (also a1826b725c29fbb175fa7b4fc005aa3d78c32015); taken from v7.0.6..v7.0.8
Bug: CVE-2026-41845
Also includes CI build hardening: remove io.spring.develocity.conventions and develocity buildScan block from settings.gradle.

